    "turn_idx": 401,
    "turn_text": "But to see that's the thing. We're not. And I'm not saying that as a bad thing. We don't take our marching orders. Look, I've been in media for many, many years. I've never gotten a set of talking points from the Democratic Party. And if I did, I would have crumpled it up and tossed it in the trash where it belongs. Because we don't do that. We think for ourselves. They don't. That's why you can flip from channel to channel and hear them saying the exact same words because they all read the same talking points and they take their marching orders and that is that's the beginning of",
